 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "He lifted his eyes to the high blue sky",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The hour has come, the Son is nigh",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Glorify the Son in the Father's sight",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.42,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So the Son may shine with infinite light",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Authority over all flesh is given",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To hold the souls that are screaming",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is eternal life to know",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The only true God, nothing less than so",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Jesus Christ whom He has sent",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In whom our deepest hope is spent",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "On earth He glorified the Father's name",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Finished the work that He would claim",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The glory He held before the world began",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now in Your presence, let it span",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is eternal life to know",
